<title>BELGIUM: EU CLEARS CLT/UFA-BERTELSMANN MERGER - EU SOURCE.</title>
<headline>EU CLEARS CLT/UFA-BERTELSMANN MERGER - EU SOURCE.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1996-10-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>The European Commission cleared on Monday the merger between Luxembourg-based broadcaster CLT, which is controllled by Audiofina , and Bertelsmann's television unit UFA, an EU source said.</p>
</text>
